# Character Attributes
# AT-33-E5-003 harness fix: all THREE possible casting-ability stats
# (INT/WIS/CHA) are pinned to 18, matching `fixture_verified_oracle_probe.rs`'s
# own `SPELL_PROBE_ABILITY_SCORE=18` used uniformly for whichever ability
# `casting_ability_for_class` (`src/rules_core/spellbook.rs`) selects for the
# class being probed. This cycle found WIS was left at 10 -- correct by
# accident for Wizard/Bard/Paladin/Sorcerer (INT/CHA-cast) but wrong for
# Cleric/Druid/Ranger (WIS-cast), producing a uniform ours-oracle=4 DC
# delta (the un-applied +4 WIS modifier) for every Cleric/Druid/Ranger
# spell that grants a save -- 103 of 103 AT-33-E5-001 "disagreements" this
# cycle, all traced to this one line, none a real engine defect.
STAT:STR|SCORE:10
STAT:DEX|SCORE:10
STAT:CON|SCORE:10
STAT:INT|SCORE:18
STAT:WIS|SCORE:18
STAT:CHA|SCORE:18
ALIGN:LN
RACE:Human

